repository-code: 'https://github.com/maehr/zenodo-uploader'
url: 'https://github.com/maehr/zenodo-uploader'
abstract: >-
  Mirror DOIs and upload records to Zenodo, from an agent or from the command line.
  Reads metadata from DataCite or Crossref, maps it onto Zenodo deposit metadata,
  attaches files, and creates or publishes depositions through the Zenodo REST API.
  Ships an MCP server, an Agent Skill, and a CLI over one core.
keywords:
  - zenodo
  - doi
  - datacite
  - crossref
  - open-science
  - research-data
  - mcp
  - model-context-protocol
  - agent-skill
